        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands and musical acts: Starsailor, White Town\n- People: James Walsh, Ben Byrne, James Stelfox, Barry Westhead, Jyoti Prakash Mishra\n- Songs and EPs: \"In the Crossfire\", Abort, Retry, Fail?\n- Topics: Iraq War\n\nFacts:\n- White Town is a British musical act that is the solo project of Jyoti Prakash Mishra.\n- Abort, Retry, Fail? is an EP released by White Town in 1996.\n- Starsailor is an English post-Britpop band formed in 2000.\n- Since its formation, Starsailor has included James Walsh as guitarist and vocalist, Ben Byrne as drummer, James Stelfox as bassist, and Barry Westhead as keyboardist.\n- \"In the Crossfire\" is a rock song written by Starsailor.\n- \"In the Crossfire\" is about the suffering of people who have lived through the Iraq War.",
